<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'خطأ — دُكّان', css: '/css/app.css' }) %>
<style>
.error-wrap{min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:2rem;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a 0%,#0c4a6e 50%,#134e4a 100%)}
.error-card{background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:2.5rem 2rem;max-width:480px;width:100%;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.4);animation:fadeInUp .4s ease}
@keyframes fadeInUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.error-icon{font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:1rem}
.error-card h2{margin:0 0 .6rem;color:#0f172a;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:900}
.error-card p{color:#64748b;font-size:.92rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;line-height:1.7}
.error-actions{display:flex;gap:.6rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.error-actions .btn{padding:.7rem 1.4rem;border-radius:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;transition:all .2s}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0ea5e9,#0284c7);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(14,165,233,.3)}
.btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.05);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-ghost{background:#f1f5f9;color:#334155;border:1px solid #e2e8f0}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:#e2e8f0}
</style>
<body class="app">
<div class="error-wrap">
  <div class="error-card">
    <div class="error-icon">😕</div>
    <h2><%= msg %></h2>
    <p>عذراً، حدث شيء غير متوقع — جرّب الرجوع أو العودة للرئيسية</p>
    <div class="error-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="javascript:history.back()">→ رجوع</a>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">🏠 الرئيسية</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
